---
import ContentPage from '../layouts/ContentPage.astro';
import { SITE, TOOLS } from '../config/site';
---

<ContentPage
  title="About"
  seoTitle="About"
  description={`${SITE.brand} builds free, transparent calculators for roofing, fencing and decking projects. Every formula is shown, sourced and tested.`}
  lede={`${SITE.brand} makes free calculators for roofing, fence and deck projects, built so you can see exactly how every number is worked out.`}
>
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <p>
    Homeowners and contractors use our tools to turn a few measurements into numbers they can act on: a roof’s pitch,
    how many bundles of shingles to order, how many posts and bags of concrete a fence needs, or how many boards cover
    a deck.
  </p>
  <ul>{TOOLS.map((t) => <li><a href={t.href}>{t.name} Calculator</a> — {t.desc}</li>)}</ul>

  <h2>How we work</h2>
  <p>
    Every calculator shows its formula and the assumptions behind it, cites the codes and product data it relies on,
    and is covered by automated tests. Calculations run in your browser; nothing you type is sent to us or stored. See
    the <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a> for details.
  </p>

  <h2>Who is behind {SITE.brand}</h2>
  <p>[Company background: who runs the site, trade experience, location.]</p>
  <p>
    Content is written by {SITE.author} and reviewed by {SITE.reviewer}, {SITE.reviewerCredential}. [Add credentials,
    licence numbers and photos.]
  </p>

  <h2>Estimates, not quotes</h2>
  <p>
    Results are planning estimates. Always confirm quantities with your supplier, follow the manufacturer’s
    instructions and check your local building code before you buy or build.
  </p>
</ContentPage>
